1
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:12,000
"Echo Of A Letter"
(Episode 7)

2
00:00:13,359 --> 00:00:14,400
Need a hand?

3
00:00:14,960 --> 00:00:15,960
I'm fine.

4
00:00:19,960 --> 00:00:20,960
Let me.

5
00:00:39,759 --> 00:00:41,159
It really is a bit tricky to undo.

6
00:00:53,079 --> 00:00:54,200
You're buying me cufflinks?

7
00:00:55,039 --> 00:00:56,158
Only you get to give gifts,

8
00:00:56,159 --> 00:00:57,159
and I can't?

9
00:00:58,000 --> 00:00:59,039
Of course not.

10
00:00:59,159 --> 00:01:00,159
Take a look.

11
00:01:08,840 --> 00:01:09,879
This pair is nice.

12
00:01:10,319 --> 00:01:11,319
Red.

13
00:01:17,400 --> 00:01:18,400
Chen Wan.

14
00:01:19,159 --> 00:01:20,159
Give me your hand.

15
00:01:32,719 --> 00:01:33,719
What's wrong?

16
00:01:33,840 --> 00:01:34,840
Are you nervous?

17
00:01:35,840 --> 00:01:36,840
No.

18
00:01:38,000 --> 00:01:39,400
Your pulse is racing.

19
00:01:40,840 --> 00:01:42,238
I wouldn't say I'm nervous.

20
00:01:42,239 --> 00:01:44,040
Just a little flattered.

21
00:01:44,439 --> 00:01:45,840
It's really nothing.

22
00:01:46,920 --> 00:01:48,159
However, if you're willing...

23
00:01:54,040 --> 00:01:55,360
If you're willing to place a bid,

24
00:01:55,680 --> 00:01:56,680
and if you happen to win,

25
00:01:57,319 --> 00:01:58,438
Minglong and I

26
00:01:58,439 --> 00:01:59,719
will be spared a lot of trouble.

27
00:02:02,400 --> 00:02:04,000
This is a gift from me to you.

28
00:02:04,200 --> 00:02:05,679
Or you can think of it as

29
00:02:05,680 --> 00:02:07,239
me bribing you in advance.

30
00:02:07,439 --> 00:02:08,439
Do you like them?

31
00:02:08,479 --> 00:02:10,216
If not, we can take our
time and keep looking.

32
00:02:10,240 --> 00:02:11,240
I like them.

33
00:02:14,280 --> 00:02:15,280
Here.

34
00:02:20,879 --> 00:02:21,879
We'll take this pair.

35
00:02:23,080 --> 00:02:24,080
Certainly, sir.

36
00:02:27,599 --> 00:02:28,959
I need to take this call.

37
00:02:28,960 --> 00:02:29,960
Excuse me.

38
00:02:38,840 --> 00:02:40,359
Could you have the craftsman
engrave a custom design

39
00:02:40,360 --> 00:02:41,520
on the back of the cufflinks?

40
00:02:41,800 --> 00:02:42,120
Sure.

41
00:02:42,120 --> 00:02:43,120
I'll draw it for you.

42
00:02:53,100 --> 00:02:54,120
Okay.

43
00:03:09,120 --> 00:03:10,120
Thank you.

44
00:03:11,719 --> 00:03:12,479
Had to take a call.

45
00:03:12,479 --> 00:03:13,479
Sorry about that.

46
00:03:15,439 --> 00:03:16,719
If you don't like them,

47
00:03:17,199 --> 00:03:18,199
don't force yourself.

48
00:03:18,680 --> 00:03:19,680
Not at all.

49
00:03:19,759 --> 00:03:20,840
I love them.

50
00:03:21,759 --> 00:03:22,759
Thank you.

51
00:03:25,520 --> 00:03:26,520
Here.

52
00:03:44,759 --> 00:03:45,759
Thank you, Mr. Zhao.

53
00:03:45,919 --> 00:03:47,000
Good night, Mr. Zhao.

54
00:03:47,280 --> 00:03:48,280
Goodbye, Chen Wan.

55
00:03:49,039 --> 00:03:50,400
Goodbye, Mr. Zhao.

56
00:03:50,719 --> 00:03:51,719
By the way,

57
00:03:51,840 --> 00:03:53,400
the bid results will be out next week.

58
00:03:53,879 --> 00:03:55,000
Got it, Mr. Zhao.

59
00:03:55,479 --> 00:03:56,479
Get some rest.

60
00:04:14,319 --> 00:04:15,439
We got it! We won the bid!

61
00:04:16,120 --> 00:04:16,839
We won!

62
00:04:16,920 --> 00:04:17,920
Chen Wan!

63
00:04:18,000 --> 00:04:19,278
We won the bid! Did you hear me?

64
00:04:19,279 --> 00:04:19,720
We won!

65
00:04:19,720 --> 00:04:20,720
I heard you.

66
00:04:22,279 --> 00:04:23,958
Why aren't you excited at all?

67
00:04:23,959 --> 00:04:25,559
Thank goodness you didn't submit that...

68
00:04:25,600 --> 00:04:26,679
bid withdrawal.

69
00:04:26,680 --> 00:04:27,958
Good thing I stopped you.

70
00:04:27,959 --> 00:04:28,959
Otherwise...

71
00:04:29,360 --> 00:04:30,680
It's all thanks to you, Han Jin.

72
00:04:31,879 --> 00:04:32,958
It was my fault.

73
00:04:32,959 --> 00:04:33,560
Tell you what,

74
00:04:33,680 --> 00:04:35,600
go share the good news with everyone first.

75
00:04:35,959 --> 00:04:37,278
If we're having a team dinner,

76
00:04:37,279 --> 00:04:38,279
it's on me.

77
00:04:38,720 --> 00:04:40,680
I'll go let all the departments know, then.

78
00:04:41,160 --> 00:04:42,160
Okay.

79
00:04:57,279 --> 00:04:58,279
Chen Wan.

80
00:04:59,759 --> 00:05:00,759
Mr. Zhao.

81
00:05:01,519 --> 00:05:02,519
Congratulations.

82
00:05:03,519 --> 00:05:04,519
Thank you.

83
00:05:05,560 --> 00:05:07,080
I heard your proposal was outstanding.

84
00:05:07,399 --> 00:05:09,159
The evaluation team
was just being generous.

85
00:05:10,720 --> 00:05:11,799
Regarding our partnership,

86
00:05:11,800 --> 00:05:13,295
it's best not to discuss it over the phone.

87
00:05:13,319 --> 00:05:14,319
Come by Minglong.

88
00:05:14,480 --> 00:05:15,480
Let's talk in person.

89
00:05:15,959 --> 00:05:16,959
Sure.

90
00:05:17,040 --> 00:05:18,400
When would be a good time for you?

91
00:05:19,199 --> 00:05:20,800
I'll head over to your office.

92
00:05:21,319 --> 00:05:22,479
I'm already done for the day.

93
00:05:23,639 --> 00:05:24,120
Got it.

94
00:05:24,639 --> 00:05:25,639
I'll head over right now.

95
00:05:26,639 --> 00:05:27,696
I'll have someone pick you up.

96
00:05:27,720 --> 00:05:28,720
That's alright.

97
00:05:28,759 --> 00:05:30,160
I can just drive myself.

98
00:05:30,360 --> 00:05:31,160
That won't work.

99
00:05:31,360 --> 00:05:32,240
It's your first time here.

100
00:05:32,241 --> 00:05:33,921
You won't get past the core zone security.

101
00:05:34,160 --> 00:05:35,576
Besides, I'm worried you'll get lost

102
00:05:35,600 --> 00:05:36,800
and won't find a parking spot.

103
00:05:37,319 --> 00:05:38,319
Alright.

104
00:05:38,439 --> 00:05:39,719
Sorry for the trouble, Mr. Zhao.

105
00:05:39,839 --> 00:05:40,839
Bye.

106
00:05:46,879 --> 00:05:47,560
Who's that?

107
00:05:47,800 --> 00:05:48,800
Zhao Shengge.

108
00:05:51,839 --> 00:05:53,199
He sent someone to pick you up?

109
00:06:14,959 --> 00:06:17,039
Mr. Chen, the boss is
waiting for you in his office.

110
00:06:18,839 --> 00:06:19,839
Mr. Zhao.

111
00:06:20,079 --> 00:06:21,079
Chen Wan.

112
00:06:22,959 --> 00:06:24,999
This is the first draft of
the contract from Legal.

113
00:06:25,319 --> 00:06:26,319
Take a look.

114
00:06:32,240 --> 00:06:33,240
What is it?

115
00:06:33,959 --> 00:06:34,959
Nothing.

116
00:06:46,120 --> 00:06:47,120
Take a look.

117
00:06:47,279 --> 00:06:48,279
Right here.

118
00:06:48,680 --> 00:06:50,559
An eight percent retention fee.

119
00:06:50,560 --> 00:06:51,600
Is that acceptable?

120
00:06:53,600 --> 00:06:54,600
No problem.

121
00:06:55,920 --> 00:06:58,240
Eight percent is the standard rate,

122
00:06:58,879 --> 00:07:00,958
and the defects liability
period is standard as well.

123
00:07:00,959 --> 00:07:01,959
I'm fine with it.

124
00:07:02,160 --> 00:07:03,160
Good.

125
00:07:03,360 --> 00:07:05,096
You don't have to make
concessions on everything.

126
00:07:05,120 --> 00:07:06,720
Feel free to voice any demands you have,

127
00:07:07,120 --> 00:07:08,240
because I'll do the same.

128
00:07:09,439 --> 00:07:11,920
The price Minglong offered
is already very generous.

129
00:07:13,000 --> 00:07:14,879
Do you have any other questions for now?

130
00:07:16,000 --> 00:07:17,279
If you don't mind me asking,

131
00:07:17,519 --> 00:07:18,399
who from Minglong

132
00:07:18,400 --> 00:07:20,279
will be in charge of this project?

133
00:07:21,000 --> 00:07:22,000
Me.

134
00:07:26,120 --> 00:07:27,120
Here's the thing.

135
00:07:27,360 --> 00:07:30,000
I've been personally overseeing
the Lai Chi Wun project all along.

136
00:07:30,160 --> 00:07:32,199
However, I'm rather particular.

137
00:07:32,519 --> 00:07:33,638
While we're working together,

138
00:07:33,639 --> 00:07:35,599
I might occasionally

139
00:07:35,600 --> 00:07:36,560
call you

140
00:07:36,561 --> 00:07:38,519
or text you for project updates.

141
00:07:39,759 --> 00:07:40,759
Sure.

142
00:07:41,000 --> 00:07:42,359
That's only natural.

143
00:07:42,360 --> 00:07:43,360
Alright.

144
00:07:43,639 --> 00:07:44,639
Let's continue, then.

145
00:07:45,079 --> 00:07:45,519
Okay.

146
00:07:45,920 --> 00:07:46,920
Look at this clause.

147
00:07:47,879 --> 00:07:49,239
Regarding this oil spill contingency plan,

148
00:07:49,240 --> 00:07:51,838
I've discussed it with my technical team.

149
00:07:51,839 --> 00:07:55,159
Our risk response mechanism
can be optimized further.

150
00:07:55,160 --> 00:07:56,759
Walk me through the details.

151
00:07:57,040 --> 00:07:58,040
Sure.

152
00:08:05,120 --> 00:08:06,200
Here's what we're thinking.

153
00:08:18,800 --> 00:08:19,800
Chen Wan.

154
00:08:20,279 --> 00:08:21,600
Are you free tonight?

155
00:08:22,439 --> 00:08:23,439
I am.

156
00:08:26,079 --> 00:08:27,079
I'd like to

157
00:08:27,439 --> 00:08:28,959
treat my soon-to-be partner

158
00:08:29,279 --> 00:08:30,279
to dinner.

159
00:08:34,720 --> 00:08:36,279
Thank you for the treat, Mr. Zhao.

160
00:09:35,200 --> 00:09:37,638
Thank you both for
choosing Puye Restaurant.

161
00:09:37,639 --> 00:09:39,759
This week's theme is Romantic Night.

162
00:09:40,720 --> 00:09:41,480
Mr. Zhao,

163
00:09:41,639 --> 00:09:43,999
this is the Royal Promise
you selected earlier.

164
00:09:44,000 --> 00:09:45,519
Allow me to pour it for you now.

165
00:09:51,039 --> 00:09:51,960
Here, honey.

166
00:09:51,960 --> 00:09:52,960
Try this.

167
00:09:57,720 --> 00:09:58,480
Gentlemen,

168
00:09:58,639 --> 00:10:00,919
the candles are here to set the mood.

169
00:10:01,080 --> 00:10:02,678
If you find them in the way,

170
00:10:02,679 --> 00:10:03,919
we can have them removed.

171
00:10:04,399 --> 00:10:05,399
No need.

172
00:10:05,519 --> 00:10:06,519
They're fine.

173
00:10:06,600 --> 00:10:07,600
Very well.

174
00:10:08,039 --> 00:10:10,239
I hope you both have an unforgettable,

175
00:10:10,240 --> 00:10:11,320
romantic evening.

176
00:10:12,639 --> 00:10:13,279
Mr. Zhao,

177
00:10:13,600 --> 00:10:16,158
the dishes you ordered
have been carefully prepared.

178
00:10:16,159 --> 00:10:17,679
Shall we start serving them now?

179
00:10:18,240 --> 00:10:19,240
Yes.

180
00:10:27,519 --> 00:10:28,559
Viola booked the place.

181
00:10:29,919 --> 00:10:30,919
Do you not like it?

182
00:10:31,399 --> 00:10:32,399
Not at all.

183
00:10:33,799 --> 00:10:34,799
I like it.

184
00:10:36,759 --> 00:10:37,759
Good.

185
00:10:38,120 --> 00:10:39,120
Here, Chen Wan.

186
00:10:40,960 --> 00:10:42,360
Here's to a successful partnership.

187
00:10:43,000 --> 00:10:44,120
To a successful partnership.

188
00:10:52,000 --> 00:10:53,200
Once the contract is signed,

189
00:10:53,639 --> 00:10:55,999
we can get the follow-up work
underway as soon as possible.

190
00:10:56,200 --> 00:10:56,840
Are you

191
00:10:57,120 --> 00:10:58,159
facing any difficulties?

192
00:10:58,519 --> 00:10:59,758
Do you have enough tech staff?

193
00:10:59,759 --> 00:11:00,679
If needed,

194
00:11:00,680 --> 00:11:02,359
Minglong can lend a hand.

195
00:11:02,360 --> 00:11:03,879
Don't worry, Mr. Zhao.

196
00:11:04,120 --> 00:11:05,959
Although Kexiang is just a small company,

197
00:11:05,960 --> 00:11:07,599
the several patents we hold

198
00:11:07,600 --> 00:11:09,239
can greatly boost efficiency.

199
00:11:09,240 --> 00:11:10,518
When I was drafting the bid proposal,

200
00:11:10,519 --> 00:11:11,960
I factored this in as well.

201
00:11:13,559 --> 00:11:14,559
As for what comes next,

202
00:11:14,879 --> 00:11:15,879
I'll test the waters step-by-step

203
00:11:15,880 --> 00:11:18,639
as the project moves forward.

204
00:11:19,080 --> 00:11:20,080
All right.

205
00:11:21,000 --> 00:11:22,158
Excuse me.

206
00:11:22,159 --> 00:11:23,159
Here is your dish.

207
00:11:23,720 --> 00:11:25,558
This is our signature snow crab.

208
00:11:25,559 --> 00:11:26,678
We recommend enjoying it while it's hot.

209
00:11:26,679 --> 00:11:27,919
It tastes much better that way.

210
00:11:28,240 --> 00:11:29,240
Please enjoy.

211
00:11:31,600 --> 00:11:32,600
Mr. Zhao,

212
00:11:32,840 --> 00:11:33,840
let me shell it for you.

213
00:11:35,759 --> 00:11:36,759
Okay.

214
00:11:38,399 --> 00:11:39,399
Excuse me.

215
00:11:46,080 --> 00:11:47,080
Hello?

216
00:11:51,919 --> 00:11:52,360
Hey.

217
00:11:52,480 --> 00:11:53,120
Are you done?

218
00:11:53,360 --> 00:11:54,398
We just got some fresh Da Hong Pao tea.

219
00:11:54,399 --> 00:11:55,399
I picked it out myself.

220
00:11:56,639 --> 00:11:57,519
I just got here.

221
00:11:57,519 --> 00:11:58,039
I'm not coming.

222
00:11:58,360 --> 00:12:00,320
Does it really take this
long to sign a contract?

223
00:12:01,759 --> 00:12:03,278
I just signed it.

224
00:12:03,279 --> 00:12:04,999
The least we could do is
have a meal to celebrate.

225
00:12:05,000 --> 00:12:06,440
He's never usually this eager.

226
00:12:06,919 --> 00:12:07,919
Go have fun on your own.

227
00:12:08,279 --> 00:12:09,279
Got it.

228
00:12:09,519 --> 00:12:10,519
How's it going?

229
00:12:12,639 --> 00:12:13,639
Hard to say.

230
00:12:14,159 --> 00:12:15,919
Though right now,
he's shelling crab for me.

231
00:12:16,240 --> 00:12:17,320
Well, aren't you something.

232
00:12:19,639 --> 00:12:20,639
Let me ask you something.

233
00:12:21,120 --> 00:12:22,280
Has he always been like this?

234
00:12:22,799 --> 00:12:23,918
So accommodating,

235
00:12:23,919 --> 00:12:25,000
giving in to every demand,

236
00:12:25,279 --> 00:12:26,759
like he doesn't have a temper at all?

237
00:12:27,080 --> 00:12:28,119
Is he like this with everyone?

238
00:12:28,120 --> 00:12:29,120
Not really.

239
00:12:29,399 --> 00:12:30,679
He's a man of principle.

240
00:12:31,279 --> 00:12:32,759
He knows his boundaries.

241
00:12:33,759 --> 00:12:36,279
He walks the fine line between
being thoughtful and kissing up.

242
00:12:37,360 --> 00:12:39,440
Sure, he might pour tea
or serve soup for Ming,

243
00:12:40,200 --> 00:12:42,160
but he'd never peel
shrimp or shell crab for him.

244
00:12:44,320 --> 00:12:45,320
Then again,

245
00:12:45,919 --> 00:12:47,320
you're his client now.

246
00:12:48,080 --> 00:12:49,480
Maybe he's just intimidated by you.

247
00:12:49,559 --> 00:12:50,559
Who knows?

248
00:12:51,720 --> 00:12:52,720
Seriously though,

249
00:12:53,120 --> 00:12:54,640
aren't you worried he isn't into guys?

250
00:12:57,200 --> 00:12:58,200
Neither am I.

251
00:12:58,320 --> 00:12:59,679
If he really isn't,

252
00:12:59,759 --> 00:13:01,000
don't do anything reckless.

253
00:13:01,960 --> 00:13:03,080
He's not just anyone.

254
00:13:03,559 --> 00:13:06,080
Ming and Zhixuan won't just
let you have your way with him.

255
00:13:07,080 --> 00:13:08,159
So,

256
00:13:08,720 --> 00:13:10,280
it's best for him to be willing.

257
00:13:13,840 --> 00:13:15,559
Why did I just get a chill down my spine?

258
00:13:16,200 --> 00:13:17,360
Am I coming down with a cold?

259
00:13:21,679 --> 00:13:22,320
Mr. Zhao.

260
00:13:22,639 --> 00:13:24,239
It's all shelled. Eat it while it's hot.

261
00:13:26,120 --> 00:13:26,559
Thank you.

262
00:13:27,039 --> 00:13:28,039
My pleasure.

263
00:13:37,679 --> 00:13:38,679
Well then, Mr. Zhao,

264
00:13:38,759 --> 00:13:39,759
goodbye.

265
00:13:40,559 --> 00:13:41,559
Goodbye, Chen Wan.

266
00:13:44,919 --> 00:13:46,039
I've got the hang of it now.

267
00:13:50,600 --> 00:13:52,600
Don't forget we're signing
the contract next week.

268
00:13:53,960 --> 00:13:54,320
Of course,

269
00:13:54,600 --> 00:13:55,600
Mr. Zhao.

270
00:13:56,000 --> 00:13:57,000
Thank you.

271
00:13:57,480 --> 00:13:58,480
See you next week.

272
00:14:57,720 --> 00:14:59,279
Here's to a successful partnership.

273
00:14:59,559 --> 00:15:00,678
To our partnership.

274
00:15:00,679 --> 00:15:01,719
Looking forward to it.

275
00:15:01,720 --> 00:15:02,720
To a great partnership.

276
00:15:04,399 --> 00:15:05,399
Mr. Chen,

277
00:15:05,519 --> 00:15:07,600
I'm really glad to have you as our partner.

278
00:15:08,320 --> 00:15:09,559
Likewise, Ms. Xu.

279
00:15:10,559 --> 00:15:11,559
The pleasure is all mine.

280
00:15:11,759 --> 00:15:13,319
We'll be seeing a lot of
each other from now on.

281
00:15:13,320 --> 00:15:14,798
Don't be intimidated just
because I'm the client, Mr. Chen.

282
00:15:14,799 --> 00:15:15,799
Not at all.

283
00:15:16,000 --> 00:15:16,240
I—

284
00:15:16,240 --> 00:15:17,240
All right.

285
00:15:17,360 --> 00:15:18,400
This meeting is adjourned.

286
00:15:23,000 --> 00:15:24,000
Everyone,

287
00:15:24,679 --> 00:15:26,960
I just set up an encrypted group chat.

288
00:15:27,240 --> 00:15:30,079
Moving forward, any
engineering issues for the project

289
00:15:30,080 --> 00:15:31,240
