I believe she's a senior marine geologist.

573
00:32:10,519 --> 00:32:11,519
Yes.

574
00:32:11,599 --> 00:32:14,582
The geological infrastructure issues
we're currently facing...

575
00:32:14,759 --> 00:32:16,479
she's the only one who can help solve them.

576
00:32:17,359 --> 00:32:19,599
We just haven't had the
chance to meet with her.

577
00:32:20,960 --> 00:32:23,040
Sounds like things have
taken a turn for the better.

578
00:32:24,359 --> 00:32:25,719
I suddenly managed
to get in touch with her.

579
00:32:25,720 --> 00:32:26,720
As luck would have it,

580
00:32:26,880 --> 00:32:27,839
she and her team

581
00:32:27,840 --> 00:32:29,680
are stranded in Haishi
because of the typhoon.

582
00:32:30,240 --> 00:32:31,880
She said she could meet with us.

583
00:32:33,119 --> 00:32:33,839
When?

584
00:32:33,839 --> 00:32:34,839
Tonight.

585
00:32:35,240 --> 00:32:36,640
I got her reply half an hour ago.

586
00:32:37,440 --> 00:32:38,599
It's pouring out there.

587
00:32:39,920 --> 00:32:41,959
They're only free tonight.

588
00:32:41,960 --> 00:32:43,240
Once the typhoon passes,

589
00:32:43,640 --> 00:32:45,640
she and her team are
flying straight to the UK.

590
00:32:46,000 --> 00:32:47,000
I'll go.

591
00:32:47,319 --> 00:32:48,319
No way.

592
00:32:52,400 --> 00:32:53,400
Fine.

593
00:32:53,440 --> 00:32:54,799
Stay safe, then.

594
00:32:56,799 --> 00:32:57,799
Let's leave it at that.

595
00:33:05,279 --> 00:33:07,399
Due to the typhoon and heavy rain,

596
00:33:07,400 --> 00:33:10,479
fragile terrain in the Eastern District
has caused landslides on several roads.

597
00:33:10,480 --> 00:33:13,799
All routes from Central to Railway
Street are completely closed.

598
00:33:16,640 --> 00:33:18,719
Sorry, the number you have dialed

599
00:33:18,720 --> 00:33:20,439
cannot be reached at the moment.

600
00:33:20,440 --> 00:33:21,799
Please try again later.

601
00:33:26,880 --> 00:33:29,159
Sorry, the number you have dialed

602
00:33:29,160 --> 00:33:30,680
cannot be reached at the moment.

603
00:33:40,279 --> 00:33:41,279
Hey, Xuan.

604
00:33:41,880 --> 00:33:43,240
What are you so busy with?

605
00:33:43,640 --> 00:33:45,656
I called you so many times
and the line was always busy.

606
00:33:45,680 --> 00:33:46,680
I was in a meeting.

607
00:33:47,160 --> 00:33:48,760
Is Zhao Shengge working you to the bone?

608
00:33:48,880 --> 00:33:49,959
Why are you in meetings every single day?

609
00:33:49,960 --> 00:33:52,494
The Observatory recently issued
the highest-level Black Rainstorm Warning...

610
00:33:52,519 --> 00:33:55,429
I don't care. After the typhoon passes,
you have to come hang out with me.

611
00:33:55,480 --> 00:33:56,039
Got it.

612
00:33:56,040 --> 00:33:57,360
Seventy-three people are injured,

613
00:33:57,599 --> 00:33:59,960
and the death toll continues to rise.

614
00:34:00,519 --> 00:34:00,920
Xuan,

615
00:34:01,279 --> 00:34:02,719
something came up, I have to go.

616
00:34:02,720 --> 00:34:04,295
I don't even know what
keeps you so busy all day.

617
00:34:04,319 --> 00:34:05,400
You promised me.

618
00:34:05,799 --> 00:34:06,799
Okay, got it.

619
00:34:11,000 --> 00:34:13,119
Sorry, the number you have dialed...

620
00:34:25,719 --> 00:34:26,719
Mr. Zhao.

621
00:34:29,679 --> 00:34:30,679
Chen Wan.

622
00:34:30,920 --> 00:34:31,920
Heading out?

623
00:34:33,440 --> 00:34:34,440
No.

624
00:34:35,559 --> 00:34:37,159
Just got back from taking out the trash.

625
00:34:37,360 --> 00:34:38,840
Did everything go smoothly, Mr. Zhao?

626
00:34:39,719 --> 00:34:40,719
In what regard?

627
00:34:42,119 --> 00:34:43,320
Your meeting with Dr. Fang.

628
00:34:43,920 --> 00:34:45,600
You might have to ask Dr. Fang about that.

629
00:34:46,039 --> 00:34:48,599
He handled most of
the technical discussions.

630
00:34:52,320 --> 00:34:54,039
Mr. Zhao, did you get caught in the rain?

631
00:34:54,559 --> 00:34:55,559
It's nothing.

632
00:34:56,800 --> 00:34:58,120
After getting caught in the rain,

633
00:34:58,519 --> 00:34:59,400
you should drink some hot water

634
00:34:59,401 --> 00:35:00,719
to ward off the chill.

635
00:35:00,920 --> 00:35:03,319
If you have ginger, some
ginger tea would be best.

636
00:35:03,320 --> 00:35:04,440
If I don't have any ginger,

637
00:35:04,679 --> 00:35:05,920
will mulled wine do?

638
00:35:07,239 --> 00:35:08,239
That works too.

639
00:35:10,079 --> 00:35:11,880
Which wine did you pick, Mr. Zhao?

640
00:35:12,599 --> 00:35:15,959
Drinking something too strong right after
catching a chill will give you a headache.

641
00:35:17,280 --> 00:35:18,280
I grabbed

642
00:35:18,519 --> 00:35:20,319
the bottle you brought
to Felipe's reception.

643
00:35:22,360 --> 00:35:24,119
Angel's Wings helps you sleep.

644
00:35:24,719 --> 00:35:26,159
Wait, you brought Angel's Wings?

645
00:35:26,440 --> 00:35:27,960
I did bring a bottle of Angel's Wings.

646
00:35:28,159 --> 00:35:29,359
What else did you bring, then?

647
00:35:30,880 --> 00:35:31,880
I don't really remember.

648
00:35:36,039 --> 00:35:37,079
Just teasing you.

649
00:35:37,639 --> 00:35:39,519
I'm actually drinking Eternal Earl.

650
00:35:40,599 --> 00:35:42,599
Eternal Earl is good for
warding off a chill, too.

651
00:35:43,880 --> 00:35:47,360
Guess who I ran into
at Jennifer's today.

652
00:35:48,360 --> 00:35:49,360
Who?

653
00:35:52,079 --> 00:35:53,199
Ms. Xu Enyi.

654
00:35:56,417 --> 00:35:58,336
The Xu family's marine patent got approved.

655
00:35:58,360 --> 00:36:00,678
They're probably looking to get it
into operation as soon as possible.

656
00:36:00,679 --> 00:36:03,215
With all the extreme marine
weather in the first half of the year,

657
00:36:03,239 --> 00:36:04,519
they must be anxious too.

658
00:36:05,519 --> 00:36:06,679
You know a lot about it.

659
00:36:07,519 --> 00:36:08,879
Know yourself and know your enemy.

660
00:36:11,920 --> 00:36:13,360
When are they launching the project?

661
00:36:13,920 --> 00:36:15,320
The 13th of next month.

662
00:36:16,199 --> 00:36:17,639
Did Xu Enyi tell you that?

663
00:36:18,719 --> 00:36:20,479
The launch date hasn't
been made public yet.

664
00:36:21,599 --> 00:36:24,000
How did you know that
I know Ms. Xu, Mr. Zhao?

665
00:36:24,400 --> 00:36:25,800
Zhuo Zhixuan mentioned

666
00:36:26,559 --> 00:36:28,039
you went on a blind date with Ms. Xu.

667
00:36:28,119 --> 00:36:28,719
I didn't.

668
00:36:28,920 --> 00:36:30,039
We're just friends.

669
00:36:31,000 --> 00:36:32,880
Is Ms. Xu not your type?

670
00:36:35,320 --> 00:36:36,599
What is your type, then?

671
00:36:40,920 --> 00:36:42,400
I don't really have one.

672
00:36:42,760 --> 00:36:43,599
Really?

673
00:36:43,719 --> 00:36:44,719
No.

674
00:36:48,079 --> 00:36:49,079
Never mind.

675
00:36:49,559 --> 00:36:50,639
Just making small talk.

676
00:36:51,440 --> 00:36:52,440
If you do,

677
00:36:52,719 --> 00:36:54,679
I can have Tan Youming
keep an eye out for you.

678
00:36:55,559 --> 00:36:56,559
I really don't.

679
00:36:59,519 --> 00:37:01,519
Don't be late for the banquet tomorrow.

680
00:37:01,760 --> 00:37:02,960
Yes, Mr. Zhao.

681
00:37:35,559 --> 00:37:37,000
Take care, Mr. Zhao.

682
00:37:44,480 --> 00:37:45,480
Mr. Zhao.

683
00:37:47,639 --> 00:37:48,639
Are you okay?

684
00:37:49,519 --> 00:37:50,519
I'm fine.

685
00:37:51,039 --> 00:37:52,759
Thanks for covering for me with the drinks.

686
00:37:53,400 --> 00:37:54,400
It's what I should do.

687
00:37:55,039 --> 00:37:56,320
Walk on the inside, Mr. Zhao.

688
00:37:58,199 --> 00:38:00,639
It's secluded out here.
Better to be careful.

689
00:38:02,239 --> 00:38:03,239
Chen Wan.

690
00:38:03,320 --> 00:38:04,400
I don't lack bodyguards.

691
00:38:06,639 --> 00:38:08,159
Your safety is very important.

692
00:38:10,239 --> 00:38:12,039
Is my safety the only thing that matters?

693
00:38:16,400 --> 00:38:18,039
Your happiness

694
00:38:18,719 --> 00:38:19,800
is very important too.

695
00:38:25,199 --> 00:38:26,199
Chen Wan.

696
00:38:27,440 --> 00:38:28,440
Look.

697
00:38:29,000 --> 00:38:30,000
Fireflies.

698
00:38:33,719 --> 00:38:35,480
Do you like fireflies, Mr. Zhao?

699
00:38:36,840 --> 00:38:38,719
I used to have a lot of insect specimens.

700
00:38:41,320 --> 00:38:42,320
Do you want one?

701
00:38:43,679 --> 00:38:44,679
What?

702
00:38:45,360 --> 00:38:46,360
A firefly.

703
00:38:46,880 --> 00:38:48,079
I can catch one for you.

704
00:39:04,199 --> 00:39:05,199
Look.

705
00:39:07,280 --> 00:39:08,360
A firefly.

706
00:39:10,280 --> 00:39:12,439
Should I go ask for a jar to put it in?

707
00:39:12,440 --> 00:39:13,440
No need.

708
00:39:15,239 --> 00:39:16,239
Just let it go.
